  "answersTheCanTheySeeButNotDoQuestion": "Yes - this is exactly the surface that separates seeing a record from performing an operation on it. `Create Contract`, `Create Equipment Contract`, `Convert Site To Project`, `Condition Bids`, `Allow Import Data Action`, `Allow Vendor Update`, `Allow WebDAV Access` are all independently securable per user class, separately from Page Access to the underlying record.",
